  "FROM THE FACTORY. FOR YOUR EVERYDAY.": "从制鞋车间，走进你的日常。",
  "Every good shoe.": "每一双好鞋，",
  "Starts with care.": "始于用心。",
  "Before there was a KENNY logo, there was a workbench. Sketches, material samples and half-finished pairs filled the space. Working close to the making taught us something simple: a great shoe is built from details most people never see.": "在 KENNY 标志诞生之前，先有一张制鞋工作台。桌上放着设计草图、面料样本，还有尚未完成的鞋。与制鞋过程朝夕相处，让我们懂得：一双好鞋，往往藏着许多不被看见的用心。",
  "We wanted to bring that care out of the workshop and into everyday life. So we imagined KENNY: a brand for the early train, the evening run and the unplanned detour. Shoes with character, made to make your next step feel like your own.": "我们想把这份用心，从车间带进每个人的日常。于是有了 KENNY：陪你赶上清晨的列车，跑过傍晚的街道，也走向一次说走就走的探索。让鞋拥有个性，也让你的每一步，都走出自己的样子。",
  "Discover our process ↗": "了解制鞋理念 ↗",
  "THE THINKING BEHIND EVERY PAIR": "每一双鞋背后的思考",
  "From an idea.": "从一个想法，",
  "To your next step.": "到你的下一步。",
  "A closer look at the shoemaking journey.": "走近一双鞋的诞生过程。",
  "The details make the difference.": "让细节，成就不同。",
  "01 / DESIGN": "01 / 设计",
