  "03 / DETAIL": "03 / 细节",
  "Start with the wearer.": "从穿鞋的人出发。",
  "A silhouette begins with a question: where will this pair take you? Shape, proportion and fit are considered together, before colour brings the idea to life.": "每一种鞋型，都从一个问题开始：你会穿着它去哪里？先思考轮廓、比例与贴合度，再用颜色赋予设计生命。",
  "Every layer has a purpose.": "每一层，都有意义。",
  "Texture, flexibility and cushioning each change how a shoe feels. The aim is a thoughtful combination that supports its intended use, from city walks to daily movement.": "触感、柔韧度与缓震，都影响着上脚体验。我们希望让材料的搭配更有意义，贴近城市漫步与日常运动的不同需求。",
  "Care in the small things.": "用心，藏在细节里。",
  "The curve of a seam. The feel of a lining. The way a lace sits. These quiet details connect design to the experience of wearing a pair every day.": "一条缝线的弧度，内衬的触感，鞋带落下的位置。这些细小的选择，把设计与每天穿着的感受连接起来。",
  "A SMALL WORKSHOP. A BIGGER IDEA.": "小小工作台，更大的想法。",
