  "A lightweight road runner with a breathable mesh upper, a supportive translucent cage and segmented foam cushioning. Built for your daily rhythm.": "轻量公路跑鞋，搭配透气网布鞋面、半透明支撑结构与分段式泡棉缓震。为你的日常节奏而设计。",
  "A bold racing concept with an ultra-light upper, a pronounced rocker sole and a sculpted heel fin. For days when you want to pick up the pace.": "大胆的竞速概念鞋款，采用轻薄鞋面、弧形滚动鞋底与立体后跟。献给想加快步伐的日子。",
  "Clean leather, soft suede panels and a flat gum sole. A timeless court silhouette made for everyday outfits and the long way home.": "简洁皮革、柔软麂皮拼接与平底生胶鞋底。经典场地鞋轮廓，轻松融入日常穿搭。",
  "A wide, stable training platform with a structured ripstop upper and a supportive midfoot strap. A grounded design for focused sessions.": "宽稳的训练鞋底，搭配挺括防撕裂鞋面与中足支撑绑带。沉稳的设计，陪你专注每一次训练。",
  "A rugged trail concept with a protective toe, rope laces and a pronounced lugged outsole. Layered textures for your next outdoor escape.": "硬朗的越野概念鞋款，配备防护鞋头、绳索鞋带与深齿外底。丰富层次，走向下一次户外探索。",
  "A sculptural high-top with a sock-knit collar and a distinctive hollow-arch sole. An expressive lifestyle silhouette with a forward-looking attitude.": "立体高帮鞋型，搭配袜套针织鞋领与独特镂空足弓鞋底。以充满个性的轮廓，表达面向未来的日常态度。",
