  "Worn with confidence.": "以自信出发。",
  "We imagine a world where the effort behind a product is as meaningful as the way it looks. KENNY is our invitation to discover that connection, from a workshop idea to a pair that becomes part of your day.": "我们相信，一件产品背后的付出，应该和它的外观一样值得被看见。KENNY 希望带你发现这份联系：从工作台上的想法，到成为你日常一部分的鞋。",
  "Our concept brings three values together: thoughtful design, honest storytelling and an open attitude to movement. You do not need a finish line to take a step forward.": "我们把用心设计、真诚讲述与自由运动这三种理念放在一起。不必先有终点，也能向前迈出一步。",
