  "I would like to preview news and offers. Optional; no messages are sent.": "我愿意预览新品与优惠信息。此项可选，不会实际发送消息。",
  "KENNY / DEMO PRIVACY": "KENNY / 演示隐私说明",
  "Your data. Your choice.": "你的资料，你来决定。",
  "This demo does not send checkout, contact, review or membership details to a server. Shopping bags, language, favourites, demo orders and voluntarily created demo profiles may be stored in your browser.": "本 demo 不会将结账、联系、评价或会员资料发送至服务器。购物袋、语言、收藏、演示订单和你自愿创建的演示资料可能保存在浏览器中。",
  "Optional analytics and marketing preferences do not activate any external scripts. No advertising pixels, analytics services or third-party login providers are connected.": "可选的分析与营销偏好不会激活外部脚本。当前未接入广告像素、分析服务或第三方登录。",
  "Manage preferences ↗": "管理偏好 ↗",
  "KENNY / DEMO TERMS": "KENNY / 演示条款",
  "Before your next step.": "迈出下一步之前。",
  "This website is a frontend demonstration. All products, prices, specifications, workshop stories, store locations and order statuses are illustrative. No payment is collected, no real order is accepted and no goods are shipped.": "本网站为前端演示，商品、价格、参数、鞋厂故事、门店与订单状态均为示范内容。不收款、不接受真实订单，也不发货。",
  "Reviews and member profiles are local previews, not verified customer accounts. Final terms, privacy policy and commercial information will be confirmed before real trading begins.": "评价与会员资料仅为本地预览，并非经过验证的顾客账号。正式交易前将确认条款、隐私政策与商业信息。",
  "KENNY / YOUR PRIVACY": "KENNY / 隐私偏好",
  "Your visit. Your choice.": "你的浏览，你来选择。",
  "Essential browser storage supports your bag and language. No analytics or marketing trackers are installed in this demo.": "必要的浏览器存储用于保存购物袋与语言设置。此 demo 未安装任何分析或营销追踪工具。",
