  "Reject optional tracking": "拒绝可选追踪",
  "Your privacy. Your choice.": "你的隐私，你来决定。",
  "This demo uses essential browser storage. No advertising or analytics trackers are installed.": "本 demo 使用必要的浏览器存储，未安装广告或分析追踪工具。",
