  "Privacy Statement": "隐私声明",
  "KENNY / CUSTOMER INFORMATION": "KENNY / 顾客须知",
  "SHOP WITH CLARITY.": "安心了解，再做选择。",
  "KNOW WHERE YOU STAND.": "明确规则，安心浏览。",
  "YOUR DATA. YOUR CHOICE.": "你的资料，你来决定。",
  "Before you place an order, understand how cancellations, returns and refunds are intended to work.": "下单之前，了解取消、退换与退款的拟定流程。",
  "The terms for exploring this KENNY concept store and its demonstration features.": "了解 KENNY 概念商城及演示功能的使用条款。",
  "Understand what stays in your browser and what is not connected in this demo.": "了解哪些资料保留在浏览器，以及哪些服务尚未接入。",
  "DEMO POLICY DRAFT — For preview only. Final terms require business confirmation before real sales or data collection.": "演示政策草案：仅供预览。真实销售或收集资料前，需根据实际经营情况确认最终条款。",
  "1. Demo status": "1. 演示状态",
  "This policy is a proposed policy for the KENNY concept store. This demo does not accept real orders, take payments or ship products. The timelines below are examples for review and do not represent an active returns service.": "本政策为 KENNY 概念商城的拟定规则。demo 不接受真实订单、不收款、也不发货。以下时限仅供评估，不代表已开通实际退换服务。",
  "2. Cancelling an order": "2. 取消订单",
  "Proposed rule: contact support as soon as possible, ideally within 24 hours of placing an order. An unprocessed order may be cancelled before dispatch. Once dispatch has begun, the return process may apply instead. The final cancellation window will be confirmed before real sales open.": "拟定规则：请尽早联系客户支持，建议在下单后 24 小时内提出。未处理的订单可在发货前申请取消；若已开始发货，可能需要按退货流程办理。最终取消时限将在真实销售前确认。",
  "3. Requesting a return or exchange": "3. 申请退换货",
  "Proposed rule: request a return within 14 days of delivery. For a change of mind or size exchange, products should be unworn, unwashed and returned with their original packaging and accessories. These conditions do not limit rights relating to faulty or incorrectly supplied products.": "拟定规则：请在签收后 14 天内申请退换。因个人意愿或尺码申请的商品，应未穿着、未清洗，并保留原包装与配件。这些条件不限制顾客对瑕疵商品或错发商品依法享有的权利。",
  "4. Faulty, damaged or incorrect products": "4. 瑕疵、损坏或错发商品",
  "If a delivered item is faulty, damaged or different from what was ordered, contact support with the order reference and a description of the issue. Photographs may help us assess it. A suitable remedy will be considered under applicable consumer law; reasonable rights are not removed by this policy.": "如收到的商品存在瑕疵、损坏或与订单不符，请提供订单编号及问题说明，照片可协助评估。我们将根据适用消费者法律考虑适当补救，不以本政策排除依法享有的权利。",
  "5. Return shipping and original delivery fees": "5. 退货运费与原配送费",
  "Proposed rule: KENNY covers reasonable return shipping for a confirmed fault or fulfilment error. For a change of mind or size exchange, the customer may be responsible for return delivery. Any original delivery refund and exchange postage will be explained before the return is accepted.": "拟定规则：确认属于商品瑕疵或配送错误时，由 KENNY 承担合理退货运费。因个人意愿或尺码更换，顾客可能需承担寄回费用。原运费是否退还及换货配送费，会在接受申请前说明。",
  "6. Refund assessment and timing": "6. 退款审核与时效",
  "Proposed rule: after an approved return has been received and assessed, a refund is initiated to the original payment method within 5–10 business days. Bank and payment-provider processing can take additional time. Actual refund terms and providers will be confirmed before launch.": "拟定规则：收到获批准的退货并完成审核后，将在 5–10 个工作日内向原付款方式发起退款。银行及支付平台可能另需处理时间。实际退款规则与支付渠道将在上线前确认。",
  "7. Starting a request": "7. 发起申请",
  "Use the contact page with your order reference, the item concerned and the reason for your request. Do not send payment-card details or passwords. The current contact form is a local demo and does not transmit a request.": "可通过联系页面提供订单编号、相关商品及申请原因，请勿发送银行卡资料或密码。当前联系表单仅为本地演示，不会实际发送申请。",
  "8. Your consumer rights": "8. 消费者权利",
  "Nothing in the final policy should exclude rights that cannot lawfully be excluded under applicable consumer law. Final commercial terms, eligible territories and support contact information will be published before the store opens for real transactions.": "最终政策不得排除适用法律规定不可排除的消费者权利。正式交易前将公布最终商业条款、服务地区及客服联系方式。",
  "1. Scope and acceptance": "1. 适用范围与接受",
  "By using this demo, you acknowledge that it is a frontend concept, not an operating online shop. The KENNY name, products, prices, specifications, store locations and factory story shown here are illustrative. Final business identity and trading terms will be confirmed before commercial launch.": "使用本 demo，即表示你了解这是一项前端概念展示，并非实际营业的网店。所展示的 KENNY 品牌、商品、价格、参数、门店及鞋厂故事均为示范内容。真实商业主体与交易条款将在正式营业前确认。",
  "2. Eligibility and member profiles": "2. 使用资格与会员资料",
  "Demo membership is intended for adults aged 18 or older. Browsing children’s products does not create an account for a child. A local demo profile is not an authenticated account; Google, Facebook and Apple sign-in previews do not connect to those providers.": "演示会员面向年满 18 岁的成年人。浏览童款不会为儿童创建账号。本地演示资料不是经过验证的账号；Google、Facebook 与 Apple 登录预览尚未连接相关服务。",
  "3. Product information and pricing": "3. 商品信息与价格",
  "Prices are displayed in Malaysian Ringgit (MYR). Product descriptions, materials and performance claims are conceptual and are not verified product specifications. Stock, taxes, final pricing, sizing and promotional conditions will be confirmed when real products become available.": "价格以马币 MYR 展示。商品描述、材料及性能说明属于概念设计，并非经过验证的真实规格。库存、税费、最终价格、尺码与优惠条件会在真实商品上架时确认。",
  "4. Orders and payment": "4. 订单与付款",
  "Adding an item to the bag or completing demo checkout does not form a sales contract. No payment details are requested, no payment is taken and no real order is accepted. Payment-method labels are previews and do not indicate a live merchant integration.": "加入购物袋或完成演示结账不会构成销售合同。网站不索取付款资料、不扣款，也不接受真实订单。付款方式仅为预览，不代表已接入商户支付服务。",
  "5. Demo promotions": "5. 演示优惠",
  "KENNY10 provides a 10% demonstration discount in this browser. Demo delivery is RM 15, waived when the merchandise total after discounts reaches RM 500. These examples have no cash value and are not a promise of future offers.": "KENNY10 在当前浏览器提供演示九折优惠。演示运费为 RM 15，折后商品金额满 RM 500 免运费。这些示范没有现金价值，也不构成未来优惠承诺。",
  "6. Reviews, messages and appropriate use": "6. 评价、留言与合理使用",
  "Local reviews, messages and profile names must not include unlawful, abusive or misleading content, someone else’s private information or third-party credentials. Demo reviews are not verified purchase reviews. Do not attempt to disrupt the website or misuse its features.": "本地评价、留言及资料姓名不得包含违法、辱骂、误导内容，或他人隐私与第三方凭证。演示评价并非真实购买验证评价。请勿破坏网站运行或滥用功能。",
  "7. Content and third-party services": "7. 网站内容与第三方服务",
  "KENNY demo artwork and site content are provided for preview. Other platform names and logos identify the intended services only and do not imply a partnership or endorsement. Social profile links are inactive until configured. External destinations, when added, will have their own terms.": "KENNY 演示图片与内容仅供预览。其他平台名称和标志仅用于识别相关服务，不代表合作或背书。社交链接在配置前不可跳转，未来外部网站将适用各自条款。",
  "8. Availability and legal rights": "8. 可用性与法定权利",
  "The demo may be changed, interrupted or removed. It is provided for evaluation rather than reliance on a live shopping service. Nothing here limits any liability or consumer right that cannot lawfully be limited. Any governing-law, dispute and commercial provisions will be confirmed before real trading.": "本 demo 可能更新、中断或移除，仅供评估，不应作为已营业购物服务依赖。本条款不限制法律规定不可限制的责任或消费者权利。适用法律、争议及商业条款将在真实交易前确认。",
  "9. Questions and policy updates": "9. 咨询与政策更新",
  "Use the contact page to preview how enquiries will be handled. Real support details and the effective date of final policies will be published before launch. Read the privacy statement and cancellation / refund policy alongside these terms.": "你可通过联系页体验咨询流程。真实客服信息及最终政策生效日期将在上线前公布。请同时阅读隐私声明与取消／退款政策。",
  "1. What this statement covers": "1. 声明适用范围",
  "This statement describes the current KENNY frontend demo. The identity and contact details of the organisation responsible for a live store will be added before commercial launch. It is not a claim that an operational retail backend or customer database exists.": "本声明适用于当前 KENNY 前端 demo。实际商店运营主体及联系方式将在正式营业前补充。本声明不表示已存在零售后台或顾客数据库。",
  "2. Information you choose to provide": "2. 你选择提供的资料",
  "A demo profile can store your name and email locally if you consent. Product reviews store the name, rating and text you enter in this browser. Checkout and contact forms use your input only for the current demonstration; that input is not sent to a KENNY server or saved as order contact data.": "经你同意，演示资料可在本地保存姓名与邮箱。评价会在浏览器保存你填写的姓名、评分及文字。结账和联系表单仅用于当前演示，不发送至 KENNY 服务器，也不作为订单联系资料保存。",
  "3. Browser storage": "3. 浏览器存储",
  "Local storage may contain shopping-bag product IDs, sizes and quantities; favourites; language and region preferences; demo profile details; demo reviews; consent choices; and demo order references, item counts, totals and dates. Order records do not include your delivery address or payment details.": "本地存储可能包含购物袋商品编号、尺码及数量，收藏，语言与地区偏好，演示资料、评价、同意选项，以及演示订单编号、数量、总额和日期。订单记录不包含地址或付款资料。",
  "4. How data is used": "4. 资料用途",
  "This information supports the demo functions you select: restoring your bag, showing saved items, changing language, displaying your voluntary profile, saving demo reviews and looking up local demonstration orders. It is not used to send marketing messages or process purchases.": "资料用于你选择的演示功能，包括恢复购物袋、显示收藏、切换语言、展示自愿创建的资料、保存演示评价及查询本地订单，不用于发送营销信息或处理真实购买。",
  "5. Cookies and optional preferences": "5. Cookie 与可选偏好",
  "The demo uses browser storage for essential functions and offers analytics and marketing preference controls. No advertising pixels or analytics SDKs are installed. Accepting optional preferences records a choice only; it does not activate a tracking service.": "demo 使用浏览器存储支持必要功能，并提供分析及营销偏好选项。当前未安装广告像素或分析工具。接受可选偏好仅记录选择，不会激活追踪服务。",
  "6. Hosting and external providers": "6. 托管与外部服务",
  "Your browser requests website files from the hosting service. The host may process technical request data, such as an IP address and access logs, under its own practices. Google, Facebook, Apple, payment providers and social platforms are not connected to the demo forms. Any future integration will require an updated notice.": "浏览器会向托管服务请求网站文件，托管商可能根据自身规则处理 IP 地址、访问日志等技术资料。Google、Facebook、Apple、支付平台及社交服务均未接入演示表单。日后接入时将更新声明。",
  "7. Retention and your choices": "7. 保存期限与你的选择",
  "Local demo data stays in this browser until you remove it, clear site storage or use the available delete controls. You can remove bag items and favourites, clear a demo profile or clear all KENNY local data with the button below. Privacy preferences can be changed at any time from the footer.": "本地演示资料保留至你删除、清理网站存储或使用相关删除按钮。你可移除购物袋与收藏、清除演示资料，或使用下方按钮清除全部 KENNY 本地资料。也可随时从页脚修改隐私偏好。",
  "8. Security and children": "8. 安全与儿童",
  "Do not enter sensitive personal information, payment-card numbers or passwords in this demo. Local browser storage is not a secure account system. Demo membership requires confirmation of age 18 or older; children’s catalogue items are intended to be viewed by an adult shopper.": "请勿填写敏感个人资料、银行卡号或密码。本地浏览器存储不是安全账号系统。演示会员要求确认年满 18 岁，童款商品面向成年顾客浏览选购。",
  "9. Rights and future changes": "9. 权利与后续更新",
  "Before real customer data is collected, KENNY will publish verified contact details, purposes, applicable legal requirements, retention arrangements, provider information and a process for privacy requests. Where applicable, access, correction, deletion and consent-withdrawal rights will be respected.": "真实收集顾客资料前，KENNY 将公布有效联系方式、用途、适用法律要求、保存安排、服务商资料及隐私申请流程，并在适用范围内保障查阅、更正、删除及撤回同意等权利。",
  "Clear all KENNY local demo data": "清除全部 KENNY 本地演示资料",
